      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Transportation Anantapur Safe Container</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	<p>When opting for car transportation services in Anantapur, it is crucial to provide the correct and up-to-date paperwork to ensure a smooth and hassle-free experience. Below is a list of vital documents required:</p>

	<p>The vehicle's original registration certificate (RC) is essential as it proves the ownership of the vehicle. A self-attested photocopy of the RC is needed to facilitate the transportation process. Make sure to get a legible and clear copy that is easily readable.</p>

	<p>A valid Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate is required to demonstrate that the vehicle meets environmental standards. The PUC certificate indicates that the vehicle has been inspected for emissions and is in a good condition to be transported. Ensure that the PUC is not expired and is valid for the duration of transportation.</p>

	<p>Protecting both your vehicle and the transport company, a valid insurance certificate is essential. This document confirms that your vehicle is insured against any potential damages or accidents during transportation. Ensure that the insurance certificate is up-to-date and covers the entire transportation period.</p>

	<p>To ensure a secure and traceable transportation process, it is crucial to provide an IBA-approved (Indian Bureau of Roads and Logistics) Consignment Bill of Lading. This document serves as a contract between you and the transportation company outlining the details of your vehicle, transportation terms, and conditions.</p>
<p>It is crucial to ensure that the bill of lading is properly filled out and signed by both parties.</p>

	<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">A 100% declared-value marine transit insurance is highly recommended for car transportation.</p>
